Qwen3.8-Flash-Next FP8 KV Cache (experimental)
===============================================

This repository contains an experimental modification of two source files from
NVIDIA's vLLM fork (the `qwen38-flash-dgx` container), and is an independent
community patch. It is NOT an official product of NVIDIA or of the vLLM project.

Upstream project: vLLM
License: Apache License 2.0
Copyright (c) the vLLM Project and its contributors.

Upstream fork: NVIDIA's vLLM fork, from which the base files inside
`patches/` are derived. The base files referenced by the patches are:

  vllm/models/qwen3_8_flash_next/nvidia/qsa.py
  vllm/models/qwen3_8_flash_next/nvidia/ops/qsa.py

The model studied is:
  Qwen3.8-Flash-Next (Qwen4ExpForConditionalGeneration) by the Qwen/Alibaba team
  (specifically the RadixArk-NVFP4 checkpoint referenced in the README).
  Qwen model weights are subject to their own license; this repository contains
  NO model weights, only source patches and documentation.

